⟪(a)⟫ of place: ⟦Matthew 15:33|Mt 15:33⟧, ⟦Luke 13:25|Lk 13:25⟧, ⟦Luke 13:27|27⟧, ⟦John 3:8|Jo 3:8⟧ ⟦John 6:5|6:5⟧ ⟦John 8:14|8:14⟧ ⟦John 9:29|9:29⟧, ⟦John 9:30|30⟧ ⟦John 19:9|19:9⟧, ⟦Revelation 7:13|Re 7:13⟧; metaph., of condition, ⟦Revelation 2:5|Re 2:5⟧;
⟪(b)⟫ of origin: ⟦Matthew 13:27|Mt 13:27⟧, ⟦Matthew 13:54|54⟧, ⟦Matthew 13:56|56⟧ ⟦Matthew 21:25|21:25⟧, ⟦Mark 6:2|Mk 6:2⟧, ⟦Luke 20:7|Lk 20:7⟧, ⟦John 2:9|Jo 2:9⟧, ⟦James 4:1|Ja 4:1⟧; of parentage, ⟦John 7:27|Jo 7:27⟧, ⟦John 7:28|28⟧;
