(corresponding to the demonstr. τοῖος and the relat. οἷος), [in LXX chiefly for ⁨אֵי־זֶה⁩;] ⟪of what quality⟫ or ⟪sort⟫: absol., n. pl., ⟦Luke 24:19|Lk 24:19⟧; c. subst.;
